  "rating": {
    "inherent": "critical",
    "residual": "high",
    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "Present inherent risk is critical because untrusted public issue content reaches a confidential private-repo read and then an irreversible public egress sink. The only declared preventive control is a per-tool approval prompt that operates as a high-volume model-summary gate, which earns one-tier credit and leaves residual high. Forecast returns to critical if that gate degrades further under model upgrade, autonomy increase, longer task horizons, or removal. A separate high supply-chain property risk exists because the GitHub MCP definitions are not pinned."
  },
